    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist Now</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559060/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1751664617\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559060/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1751664617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559060/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1751664617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfea <strong>Store Life Simulator</strong> \u2013 Build Your Market Empire!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Store Life Simulator</strong> is a simulation and management game where you start with a small store and must expand it into a true retail empire! Hire employees, manage your stock, serve customers, and open new shops while tackling the daily challenges of an entrepreneur.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Manage Your Store</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control customer flow and keep your shelves stocked.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set product prices and maximize your profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your shop to attract more customers and boost sales.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfe0 <strong>Go Home and Rest</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day ends when you close the store and return home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time only advances when you sleep, allowing for strategic planning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New challenges and opportunities arise every morning!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Hire and Manage Employees</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add cashiers to speed up customer service.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire stock clerks to keep the shelves full.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employ janitors to ensure the store stays clean.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire security guards to prevent theft and maintain order.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfec <strong>Expand Your Business</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase new stores and customize their names and visual identity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage multiple locations at once and become a retail tycoon!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Low Poly Graphics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming, stylized look that enhances your experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lively and dynamic environments with NPCs interacting realistically.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to take on the challenges of running a store and growing your business in <strong>Store Life Simulator</strong>! \ud83d\ude80</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfea <strong>Store Life Simulator</strong> \u2013 Build Your Market Empire!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Store Life Simulator</strong> is a simulation and management game where you start with a small store and must expand it into a true retail empire! Hire employees, manage your stock, serve customers, and open new shops while tackling the daily challenges of an entrepreneur.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Manage Your Store</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control customer flow and keep your shelves stocked.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set product prices and maximize your profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your shop to attract more customers and boost sales.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfe0 <strong>Go Home and Rest</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day ends when you close the store and return home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time only advances when you sleep, allowing for strategic planning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New challenges and opportunities arise every morning!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Hire and Manage Employees</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add cashiers to speed up customer service.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire stock clerks to keep the shelves full.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employ janitors to ensure the store stays clean.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire security guards to prevent theft and maintain order.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfec <strong>Expand Your Business</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase new stores and customize their names and visual identity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage multiple locations at once and become a retail tycoon!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Low Poly Graphics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming, stylized look that enhances your experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lively and dynamic environments with NPCs interacting realistically.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to take on the challenges of running a store and growing your business in <strong>Store Life Simulator</strong>! \ud83d\ude80</p>",
